<h3>About Industrial Hygiene &amp; Hazardous Materials Management</h3>

<p>Industrial Hygiene &amp; Hazardous Materials Management is a lab manual that also offers students supporting course materials that will serve in a variety of Environmental Science courses. The content instructs students to develop experiments and record their findings correctly.</p>

